date: 2026-06-05T16:40:21-04:00
---

The Crowded Flea is a pub on the edge of the Fousan River in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]]. It's a popular spot for the dockworkers in the area. It's also the main hideout of the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]].

The building is ramshackle and stands out on a pier over the water, marked by a crude drawing of a cluster of fleas on a hanging sign. Inside, it still wears the nautical theme it was fitted with about fifty years ago, props and upholstery and all, and a sign over the front reads "seat yourself or shut up." The regulars are dockhands and warehouse workers, and the place is a dive.

A hairy humanoid works the door in a round hat (he also gives his name as Johnny), which marks the tavern as under the gang's protection; the gang's own members sit in a back corner without the hats, where their matching clothes and weapons set them apart from the dockworkers. A taller, bluish-skinned half-giant holds court among them.

The gang's back room has windows that look out onto the docks and no skylight; to see inside, a watcher has to stand at ground level where the people within can see them. The front door is watched by a bouncer in a round hat, and a service stair on the left leads out.

Down the riverfront, where the warehouses and dockyards give way to the water, is Pier 54, where the gang arranged its meetings with those who asked after [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn]].
